  m_text: 'Once upon a time, there was a miner named Jax.


    One day, while exploring
    the mine, he accidentally fell into a deep hole and found himself trapped deep
    underground.


    With no way back, Jax discovers an abandoned minecart. Now,
    he must use it to navigate through the dangerous tunnels, avoid deadly traps
    and toxic acid, and find his way back to the surface.


    Will Jax make it
    out alive?'
